- The archive insert assumes no row with the same `ORDER_ID` already exists in `HARNESS_APP.ORDERS_ARCHIVE`. If duplicates are possible, the desired merge/update behavior needs to be specified.
- The cursor orders by `ORDER_ID`, which is the primary key, so batch ordering is deterministic and there are no ties on `ORDER_ID`.
